  {"g3:0823889d", "Oh! That's a SCANNER!\\n\\nListen, can I get you to deliver that\\nto CAPT. STERN?\\n\\nI want to investigate this ship a\\nlittle more.", "Oh! Isso é um SCANNER!\\n\\nEscute, poderia entregá-lo\\npara o CAPT. STERN?\\n\\nAinda preciso terminar de\\ninvestigar este navio."},
